# Pallet Point (CIPlay vi_pallet_point; VI1 vehicle island): quest "Last Shift", the five steps in order
island Pallet Point
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Last Shift
expect hidden forkcrate
zone yard
expect step 1
read Foreman's notice
expect step 2
kill Rat
